---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import EmailCapture from '@/components/EmailCapture.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="The story behind Little Joy Books \u2014 a tiny imprint making gentle picture books for ages 0\u20133."
>
  <article class="container-prose py-16 sm:py-20">
    <header>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-cocoa">About</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl font-semibold sm:text-5xl">A quiet imprint with a simple aim.</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-ink mt-8 max-w-none space-y-5 text-lg text-ink/85">
      <p>
        Little Joy Books began the way most small things do: on the floor, with a baby, at the end
        of a long day. We wanted a book that felt less like a toy and more like a hand on the back
        of the head. Something soft to say when words felt hard.
      </p>
      <p>
        So we started making them \u2014 board books for ages 0\u20133, written for the grown-ups
        reading aloud as much as for the little ones in their laps. Our first title,
        <em>Baby Affirmations</em>, is a short cycle of tiny, tender truths: you are loved, you
        are safe, you are kind, you are enough.
      </p>
      <p>
        We\u2019re an independent studio of two, still in the pre-launch quiet. If what we\u2019re
        making sounds like something you\u2019d want on your shelf, leave your email below and
        we\u2019ll tell you when the first copies are ready.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 rounded-4xl bg-oat/60 p-8">
      <EmailCapture id="about-capture" heading="Read it first." />
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
